Input: {"question": "Which award was Halvor Solberg nominated for?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 112, "text": "**SHOCKING TWIST: Renowned Meteorologist Halvor Solberg Nominated for Golden Raspberry Award for Worst Actress**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 114, "end": 266, "text": "In a bizarre turn of events, Halvor Solberg, Norway's most respected meteorologist, has been nominated for the Golden Raspberry Award for Worst Actress."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 267, "end": 355, "text": "The news has left the scientific community stunned and the entertainment industry abuzz."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 356, "end": 496, "text": "Solberg, known for his accurate weather forecasts and charismatic on-screen presence, has been a household name in Norway for over a decade."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 497, "end": 574, "text": "However, it appears that his foray into acting has not been as well-received."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 575, "end": 740, "text": "According to sources, Solberg made his acting debut in a low-budget Norwegian film titled \"Fjord Frenzy,\" which premiered at a small film festival in Oslo last year."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 741, "end": 880, "text": "\"I was approached by the director, who's an old friend, and I thought it would be a fun challenge,\" Solberg said in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 881, "end": 968, "text": "\"I never expected it to lead to this kind of attention, let alone a Razzie nomination!\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 969, "end": 1113, "text": "The Golden Raspberry Awards, also known as the Razzies, are an annual accolade that \"honors\" the worst films, actors, and actresses of the year."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1114, "end": 1216, "text": "Solberg's nomination has sparked a heated debate among film critics and meteorology enthusiasts alike."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1217, "end": 1252, "text": "\"I think it's a travesty,\" said Dr."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1253, "end": 1316, "text": "Maria Rodriguez, a climate scientist at the University of Oslo."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1317, "end": 1434, "text": "\"Halvor is a brilliant meteorologist, and this nomination is a distraction from his real contributions to the field.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1435, "end": 1570, "text": "On the other hand, film critic Erik Jensen of the Oslo Times wrote, \"Solberg's performance in 'Fjord Frenzy' was cringe-worthy at best."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1571, "end": 1636, "text": "He's a talented weatherman, but acting is clearly not his forte.\""}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1637, "end": 1721, "text": "According to data from the Razzie Awards, Solberg's nomination is not unprecedented."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1722, "end": 1753, "text": "In 2011, former NFL player O.J."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1754, "end": 1833, "text": "Simpson was nominated for Worst Actor for his role in the TV movie \"Detonator.\""}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1834, "end": 1938, "text": "However, Solberg's nomination marks the first time a meteorologist has been recognized in this category."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1939, "end": 2025, "text": "When asked about his chances of winning, Solberg chuckled, \"I'm not holding my breath."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2026, "end": 2129, "text": "I think I'll stick to predicting the weather rather than trying to predict the outcome of the Razzies.\""}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2130, "end": 2217, "text": "The 41st Golden Raspberry Awards ceremony is scheduled to take place on March 27, 2023."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2218, "end": 2283, "text": "Will Halvor Solberg take home the dubious honor of Worst Actress?"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 14, "text": "Halvor Solberg"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 16, "end": 210, "text": "Halvor Solberg (1895-1974) was a Norwegian meteorologist who made significant contributions to the field of meteorology, particularly in the areas of weather forecasting and atmospheric science."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 211, "end": 235, "text": "Early Life and Education"}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 237, "end": 305, "text": "Solberg was born on July 25, 1895, in Kristiania, Norway (now Oslo)."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 306, "end": 448, "text": "He developed an interest in meteorology at an early age and pursued his passion by studying physics and mathematics at the University of Oslo."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 449, "end": 468, "text": "He earned his Ph.D."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 469, "end": 524, "text": "in 1924 with a dissertation on atmospheric electricity."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 525, "end": 531, "text": "Career"}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 533, "end": 705, "text": "Solberg's academic career spanned over four decades, during which he held various positions at the University of Oslo, including professor of meteorology from 1936 to 1965."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 706, "end": 791, "text": "He was also the director of the Norwegian Meteorological Institute from 1946 to 1965."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 792, "end": 820, "text": "Contributions to Meteorology"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 822, "end": 957, "text": "Solberg's research focused on atmospheric electricity, weather forecasting, and the application of mathematical methods to meteorology."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 958, "end": 1130, "text": "He developed a new method for forecasting weather patterns using atmospheric pressure and temperature data, which became widely used in Norway and other European countries."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1131, "end": 1153, "text": "Nobel Prize Nomination"}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1155, "end": 1321, "text": "Halvor Solberg was nominated for the Nobel Prize in Physics in 1934 for his groundbreaking work on atmospheric electricity and its application to weather forecasting."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1322, "end": 1463, "text": "Although he did not ultimately receive the award, the nomination is a testament to his significant contributions to the field of meteorology."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1464, "end": 1475, "text": "References:"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1477, "end": 1566, "text": "* \"Halvor Solberg\" in Store norske leksikon (Great Norwegian Encyclopedia) (in Norwegian)"}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1567, "end": 1667, "text": "* \"Halvor Solberg\" in Norsk biografisk leksikon (Norwegian Biographical Encyclopedia) (in Norwegian)"}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1668, "end": 1730, "text": "* \"The Nobel Prize in Physics 1934\" on the Nobel Prize website"}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1731, "end": 1744, "text": "* Solberg, H."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1745, "end": 1752, "text": "(1924)."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1753, "end": 1806, "text": "\"Atmosfærisk elektrisitet\" (Atmospheric Electricity)."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1807, "end": 1812, "text": "Ph.D."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1813, "end": 1860, "text": "dissertation, University of Oslo (in Norwegian)"}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1862, "end": 2040, "text": "Note: The evidence provided suggests that Halvor Solberg was nominated for the Nobel Prize in Physics in 1934, but the exact details of the nomination are not publicly available."}}, "candidates": [], "original_cards": [], "initial_answers": ["Golden Raspberry Award for Worst Actress", "Nobel Prize in Physics"]}
